      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-06-033\" hidden></div>\n<h2 class=\"mm-heading mm-h2 mm-header-banner\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9700]\" style=\"background-color: #2F5496; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>22. </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>SURGICAL\u00a0SMOKE</strong></span></h2>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9701]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Following energy devices are used in surgery:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9702]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>1. Electrosurgical</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9703]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>2. Laser</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9704]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>3. Ultrasonic</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9705]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>4. Plasma energy devices</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9706]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Surgical Plume/Surgical Smoke:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9707]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Are the vapor produced during surgical procedures while using energy devices</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9708]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Contain hazardous substances including ultrafine particle, bacteria, viruses, cellular debris, toxic gasses and vapours</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9709]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Exposure can lead to various health issues to surgical staff including respiratory problems, eye and throat irritation and potential long term health effects like carcinogenesis</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9710]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>More in monopolar (@ 100</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>0</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>) than bipolar (@ 200</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>0</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>)</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9711]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Composition of Plume:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9712]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>95% water</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9713]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>5% particles</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9714]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Particle size:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9715]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Upto 100um</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9716]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Smallest \u2013 0.7um in electrosurgery</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9717]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Large \u2013 0.31um in laser</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9718]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Largest \u2013 0.3-0.6um in ultrasonic devices</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9719]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Below 10 um =&gt; inhalable</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9720]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Below 5um =&gt; deposited in nose, pharynx, trachea.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9721]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Below 25um =&gt; deeper penetration and inflamatory response</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9722]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Particle concentration:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9723]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>More concentrated in fat and viscera</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9724]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Less concentrated in muscles</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9725]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Measures to reduce risk of surgical smoke:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9726]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>PPE</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9727]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Surgical mask filters upto 5um particles</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9728]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Filters upto 0.1um.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9729]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Surgical evacuation system</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9730]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Portable</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9731]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Local exhaust ventilatio</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9732]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Wall suction devices</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9733]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Choosing the right devices</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9734]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Using bipolar instead of monopolar</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9735]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Lower power setting</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9736]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Minimum necessary use of devices</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9737]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9738]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9739]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9740]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9741]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9742]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9743]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9744]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9745]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9746]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9747]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9748]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9749]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9750]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9751]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9752]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9753]